{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防處在粉嶺搗破非法加油站，檢獲975升柴油。非法加油站設於一間鐵皮屋內。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防處周一起一連三日，在北區打擊非法加油活動，周一及周二在粉嶺先後搗破同一個非法加油站，檢獲市值約3.6萬元柴油，可入滿至少15輛輕型貨車的油缸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FUEL-1730_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20265prAoHqQAL1787742415.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FUEL-1730_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FUEL-1730.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026A7us19yqN61787742405.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FUEL-1730.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">行動中發現一批入油工具，並截查兩名男子，他們涉嫌違反《危險品條例》等，將被檢控。消防處已檢走涉案柴油，並會向法庭申請充公。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T11:19:52.658691+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}